// The champion creator's own moves (20 §8.2): moves no champion carries, for any humanoid build.
// Each is an ability as champion files write it (its default numbers, which the balance step
// tunes), the library clip it plays (`clip`, from art/library/biped: a dash plays
// `<clip>_start`, `_travel` and `_land`), its effects by phase (the VFX kit, 05 §5.1, painted in
// the champion's signature hue like every move's), and the move whose sounds it borrows.
// `ultimate: true` keeps a move on R.
//
